# S-843 T-958: Column constraint annotation [_ : Int] parsed by resolve_type_dict (T-950).
# When the key is the wildcard sentinel `_`, resolve_type_dict sets
# RowTail::Uniform{key: None, value: Int} instead of adding to named fields.
#
# The function is defined but not called — tests annotation resolution only.
# The call site (unify_rows with Empty vs Uniform) is separately deferred.
# Absence of === warn asserts the annotation resolves cleanly (no unknown-type warning).
[
  f: [fn [let x@[_ : Int]] x]
  result: 42
]
=== out
Dict({"f": Function(x), "result": Int(42)})
